flowchart TD
    A[geometry_filter.py] --> B[compute_geometry]

    B --> C[Inputs:<br/>depth image + bounding box + parameters]
    C --> D[Apply inward inset to bounding box]
    D --> E[Extract depth pixels inside the box]
    E --> F[Remove invalid and excessively distant depth values]

    F --> G{Valid depth inside box?}
    G -- No --> H[Return invalid statistics]
    G -- Yes --> I[Extract surrounding annulus]
    I --> J[Remove the box area from the annulus]
    J --> K{Valid floor depth around box?}

    K -- No --> H
    K -- Yes --> L[Estimate floor depth using median]
    L --> M[Calculate in-box depth statistics]
    M --> N[Find pixels raised above the floor]
    N --> O[Calculate raised-pixel fraction]

    O --> P[Calculate 3D extent of raised pixels]
    P --> Q[Calculate width-to-depth aspect ratio]
    Q --> R[Measure raised top-surface flatness]
    R --> S[Calculate diagnostic edge and center statistics]
    S --> T[Return statistics dictionary]

    H --> U[decide]
    T --> U

    U --> V{Statistics valid?}
    V -- No --> W[KEEP<br/>no depth statistics]
    V -- Yes --> X{Enough valid depth pixels?}

    X -- No --> Y[KEEP<br/>low depth quality]
    X -- Yes --> Z{Raised fraction sufficient?}

    Z -- No --> AA[REJECT<br/>flat]
    Z -- Yes --> AB{Aspect ratio acceptable?}

    AB -- No --> AC[REJECT<br/>aspect]
    AB -- Yes --> AD{Top surface flat enough?}

    AD -- No --> AE[REJECT<br/>no planar top]
    AD -- Yes --> AF[KEEP<br/>all tests passed]
